---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getTranslations, getLocalizedPath } from '../../../i18n';

const lang = 'en';
const t = getTranslations(lang);

const locationName = "Palamós";
const locationSlug = "palamos";

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: 'https://dirtyrabbit.es/en/' },
  { name: 'Guide', url: 'https://dirtyrabbit.es/en/guide/' },
  { name: `Best coffee near ${locationName}`, url: `https://dirtyrabbit.es/en/guide/best-coffee-${locationSlug}` }
];
---

<Layout 
  title={`Best Specialty Coffee near ${locationName} — Local Guide 2026`}
  description={`Where to find specialty coffee in ${locationName}, Costa Brava. Honest guide from Zero Café to Dirty Rabbit in S'Agaró.`}
  lang={lang}
  articleMeta={{ datePublished: "2026-02-15", dateModified: "2026-03-06", section: "Coffee Guide" }}
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>

  <article class="py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      
      <header class="mb-12">
        <p class="font-mono text-sm text-red tracking-wider mb-4">LOCAL GUIDE · SPECIALTY COFFEE</p>
        <h1 class="font-typewriter text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl mb-6">
          Best Specialty Coffee near {locationName}
        </h1>
        <p class="font-mono text-lg text-black/70 leading-relaxed">
          Palamós is synonymous with red prawns — the most prized seafood in the Mediterranean. Authentic fishing port, active fish auction every afternoon, and a fishing museum worth the visit. But beyond the seafood, where do you get good coffee? Here's our guide.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        
        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="font-typewriter text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4">☕ Zero — Specialty coffee in Palamós</h2>
          <p class="font-mono text-sm text-black/60 mb-4">Carrer Pagès Ortiz, 55, Palamós · In the centre</p>
          
          <p class="mb-4">
            Zero is the specialty option in Palamós itself. Specialty coffee (espresso, filter, cold brew), breakfast and lunch with vegan options. Quiet atmosphere, away from the tourist port area. Free Wi-Fi, pet-friendly, terrace.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Open daily 8:00–15:00. Perfect rating on TripAdvisor.
          </p>
          <p class="font-mono text-sm"><strong>Best for:</strong> An oasis of quality in an area where good coffee is scarce.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="font-typewriter text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4">☕ Dupla — New in Sant Antoni de Calonge</h2>
          <p class="font-mono text-sm text-black/60 mb-4">Sant Antoni de Calonge · 8 min drive</p>
          
          <p class="mb-4">
            Relatively new on the scene, Dupla is a specialty coffee and brunch spot near Sant Antoni's seafront. Still building its reputation, but early signs are promising. We recommend checking their Instagram for hours before visiting.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-16 p-8 bg-cream rounded-xl border-2 border-red">
          <h2 class="font-typewriter text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="text-3xl">🐇</span> Dirty Rabbit — 15 minutes worth taking
          </h2>
          <p class="font-mono text-sm text-red mb-4">Avenida Platja d'Aro 275, S'Agaró · 15 min drive from Palamós</p>
          
          <p class="mb-4">
            If you fancy turning your morning coffee into a small excursion, Dirty Rabbit is 15 minutes along the coast — and the journey is worth it.
          </p>
          
          <p class="mb-4">
            We serve <strong>La Cabra</strong>, the Danish roaster that's been among the world's best for years. Every bean is fully traceable: farm, altitude, variety, process. We prepare it on our <strong>La Marzocco KB90</strong> with <strong>RO-filtered water</strong>. This isn't "good for Costa Brava" coffee — it's world-class, full stop.
          </p>
          
          <p class="mb-4">
            Beyond coffee, you can have a leisurely breakfast (eggs benedict, toast, bowls), stay reading with a flat white, or simply enjoy the calm of S'Agaró. We're 3 minutes from Sant Pol Beach — perfect for combining coffee and a swim.
          </p>

          <h3 class="font-typewriter text-xl mt-8 mb-4">Our three pillars</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 mb-6">
            <li><strong>Wild Comfort</strong> — A place that's wild and cosy at once.</li>
            <li><strong>Intention</strong> — Everything we do has a why.</li>
            <li><strong>Belonging</strong> — A place where you fit in, wherever you're from.</li>
          </ul>
          
          <p class="mb-4">
            We speak <strong>Spanish, Catalan, English, and Polish</strong>. Menus in Russian, French, and Ukrainian.
          </p>
          
          <a 
            href="https://www.google.com/maps?cid=13237319999262880412" 
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-block font-typewriter text-red hover:underline"
          >
            📍 View on Google Maps →
          </a>
        </section>

        <h2 class="font-typewriter text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-6 mt-16">Distances from {locationName}</h2>
        
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full font-mono text-sm">
            <thead>
              <tr class="border-b-2 border-black">
                <th class="text-left py-3">Café</th>
                <th class="text-left py-3">Time</th>
                <th class="text-left py-3">Type</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr class="border-b border-black/20">
                <td class="py-3">Zero</td>
                <td class="py-3">In Palamós</td>
                <td class="py-3">Specialty café</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-black/20">
                <td class="py-3">Dupla</td>
                <td class="py-3">8 min</td>
                <td class="py-3">Specialty + brunch</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-black/20">
                <td class="py-3">La Maglia</td>
                <td class="py-3">10 min</td>
                <td class="py-3">Own roastery</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-black/20">
                <td class="py-3 font-bold">Dirty Rabbit</td>
                <td class="py-3">15 min</td>
                <td class="py-3">La Cabra (Denmark)</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>


        <div class="mt-12 mb-8 p-6 bg-cream rounded-xl">
          <h2 class="font-typewriter text-2xl mb-4">You might also like</h2>
          <ul class="font-mono text-sm space-y-3">
            <li>☕ <a href="/en/guide/best-coffee-girona" class="text-red hover:underline">Best Specialty Coffee in Girona Province</a></li>
            <li>🍵 <a href="/en/matcha" class="text-red hover:underline">Best Matcha on the Costa Brava — Ceremonial Grade in S'Agaró</a></li>
            <li>🫖 <a href="/en/guide/chai-latte-sagaro" class="text-red hover:underline">Chai Latte in S'Agaró — What to Expect</a></li>
            <li>🍳 <a href="/en/articles/brunch-sagaro" class="text-red hover:underline">Brunch in S'Agaró — Dirty Rabbit Specialty Coffee</a></li>
            <li>🌅 <a href="/en/articles/breakfast-costa-brava" class="text-red hover:underline">Best Breakfast on the Costa Brava (2026)</a></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-16 p-8 bg-black text-white rounded-xl text-center">
          <p class="font-typewriter text-2xl mb-4">Coming to see us?</p>
          <p class="font-mono mb-6">
            Dirty Rabbit · Avenida Platja d'Aro 275, S'Agaró<br>
            15 minutes from Palamós. The best coffee on Costa Brava awaits.
          </p>
          <a 
            href="https://www.google.com/maps?cid=13237319999262880412"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer" 
            class="inline-block font-typewriter px-8 py-3 bg-red text-cream rounded-lg hover:bg-red/90 transition-colors"
          >
            Get directions
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

</Layout>
